1
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,160
If today we win,

2
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:36,880
I'll play ukulele for you every day, okay?

3
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:41,960
You know, Por Chang,

4
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:45,280
this is my first time
presenting a giant buffalo.

5
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:47,120
But I'll do my best.

6
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:50,680
Let's show everyone here

7
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:53,440
that this giant albino buffalo
named Por Chang

8
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:55,200
is as majestic as any buffalo out there.

9
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,040
Let's do this together, Por Chang!

10
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,880
Auem. Auem.

11
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,320
Did Uncle Tik stop by?

12
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,840
No. Why?

13
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,360
He's gone, and he wouldn't
answer my calls.

14
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,520
What?

15
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,480
Por Chang.

16
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,000
Easy, Por Chang.

17
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:23,040
Maybe Uncle Tik is taking a walk
somewhere around here.

18
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,520
He'll be back soon.

19
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,680
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">And here</font></font></i>

20
00:02:29,760 --> 00:02:32,440
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">is the highlight of today's competition!</font></font></i>

21
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:36,360
The adult male giant buffalo competition.

22
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:38,240
Let's meet our first competitor.

23
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:46,200
Number 8,

24
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:49,880
Khun Khao from Chok Charoensuk Farm.

25
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,840
-A big applause, please!
-Khun Khao!

26
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:03,080
Khun Khao is four years
and five months old.

27
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:06,320
His height is 163 centimeters.

28
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:12,040
He's expected to reach up
to 180 centimeters tall when fully grown.

29
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:24,080
Wow, here's our next competitor.
He isn't exactly new to this.

30
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:28,120
He's entered competitions before,
but he's been out of the game for years.

31
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:32,120
Now he's back. Number 15,

32
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:36,760
Por Chang, the albino buffalo
from Dan Dao Buffalo Farm.

33
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:49,720
Por Chang.

34
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:54,320
I know you're worried about Uncle Tik.

35
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,840
But if you want to make him happy,

36
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:59,360
we have to get through
this round together.

37
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:29,480
Alright, it's time to announce

38
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:32,600
the five giant buffaloes
that have made it to the final round.

39
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:33,960
FIRST PRIZE
FIRST-RUNNER UP

40
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:36,720
The first one is…

41
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:51,560
is…

42
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:56,120
Por Chang, the albino buffalo
from Dan Dao Buffalo Farm!

43
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,720
FRESHLY MADE MEATBALLS

44
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:13,080
Sa-Ing, Auem just got through
to the final!

45
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:17,920
That's nothing. Let's celebrate
when she actually wins.

46
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,840
BUFFALO COMPETITION

47
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:23,720
At least she got through.

48
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,600
Guys, watch me eat this.

49
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,600
Phrik!

50
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:31,600
Now some more noodles.

51
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:34,040
Huh? Phrik who?

52
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:38,240
She runs a food review channel
called Chili and Salt.

53
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:40,200
-Hundreds of thousands of followers.
-Really?

54
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:45,080
Maybe if we let her try our meatballs,
we'll get more customers.

55
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,320
-Yeah.
-True.

56
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:47,760
Are you done?

57
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:49,320
-Yes, Mom.
-All done.

58
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:51,280
-Be sweet!
-Okay.

59
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,440
Go on.

60
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,600
Big smile!

61
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:56,400
Hi, Phrik.

62
00:05:57,280 --> 00:05:59,160
I've got some meatballs for you to try.

63
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:01,520
These are from
Beauty Queen Sa-Ing Meatballs Shop.

64
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:04,760
If they're good, please give us a review.

65
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:16,160
So? Did you find Uncle Tik?

66
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:20,440
No. Din and I looked everywhere.
He wasn't even at the grocery market.

67
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:23,920
Unless he's back before the next round,
Por Chang will be too restless to compete.

68
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:26,520
We have to do
whatever it takes to find him

69
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:28,600
before Por Chang's next round.

70
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:38,120
Attention. We're looking for Mr. Tik
or Mr. Thanapon Sakulyod.

71
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:42,200
If you hear this, please meet your family
at the buffalo show ring.

72
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:43,240
Excuse me.

73
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:46,360
Have you seen this guy around here?

74
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:48,040
No, I haven't.

75
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:51,480
-Not at all? Alright, thank you.
-Not at all.

76
00:07:02,760 --> 00:07:05,320
-You sure you got everything sorted?
-Yes, boss.

77
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:19,680
Hom Thong's practically perfect
in this competition.

78
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:23,360
He's well-proportioned,
with a smooth coat and glossy skin.

79
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:27,400
Broad head and neck, with horns
that complement his head.

80
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:32,240
Thick, powerful neck. Full chest,
with well-developed muscles.

81
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:36,440
His hips also slope smoothly
into his rump and the base of his tail.

82
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:41,160
Wow, with all those compliments,
we might as well just let Hom Thong win.

83
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:44,520
Which buffalo would you all like to see
win first prize?

84
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:45,840
Which one?

85
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:48,000
-Which one?
-Hom Thong!

86
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,600
-Hom Thong!
-Hom Thong!

87
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:51,680
Hom Thong!

88
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,320
Hom Thong! Hom Thong!

89
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:55,200
Alright, ladies and gentlemen.

90
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:59,280
I'll now announce
the winner of first place.

91
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:03,280
The category is black male buffaloes,
junior milk-tooth division.

92
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,800
The winner is…

93
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:05,920
Number…

94
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:12,080
Number 19! Hom Thong
from Chok Charoensuk Farm!

95
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:21,280
Hom Thong!

96
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,600
-Good job, Hom Thong!
-Hom Thong!

97
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:31,640
Auem.

98
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:33,159
How's it going, Din?

99
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:37,280
-I should help you look for him.
-It's okay.

100
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,240
You'll have to compete in the next round.

101
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:42,039
Leave this to Din and me.

102
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:01,560
These meatballs are so bouncy!
Packed full with porky goodness.

103
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:04,360
They're even better
with the dipping sauce.

104
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:07,560
If you're here at the Nakhon Ratchasima
Buffalo Competition,

105
00:09:07,640 --> 00:09:11,600
come get your meatballs
at Beauty Queen Sa-Ing's meatballs shop.

106
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:15,320
Where do you usually set up shop?

107
00:09:15,400 --> 00:09:19,280
Oh, at Wandi Wittaya School in Ayutthaya.

108
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:22,880
Yes, right at the school.
We have assorted dishes too.

109
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,800
Our food's good.

110
00:09:24,880 --> 00:09:27,080
If this sounds good to you,
be sure to stop by.

111
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:30,240
-Please stop by.
-Thank you so much, Phrik.

112
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,520
With pleasure.

113
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:33,640
Let's go over there.

114
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:36,440
I saw some really yummy-looking
salt-roasted duck just now.

115
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:38,160
Let's go.

116
00:09:39,520 --> 00:09:40,800
Thanks.

117
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:42,280
BEAUTY QUEEN SA-ING'S
MEATBALLS SHOP

118
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,280
-Will we be on TV?
-Orn.

119
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,720
Yeah. There was a camera too!

120
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:47,520
I thought I saw you
on Phrik's live stream.

121
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:50,240
What happened to a day out
in Bangkok with your mom?

122
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,600
Why are you here selling meatballs?

123
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:54,840
Well…

124
00:09:56,920 --> 00:10:00,760
We were going to, but the person
we hired to run the stall bailed on us.

125
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,520
So my mom and I have to help out.

126
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:07,280
Here, try some of my meatballs.

127
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,360
-Thank you.
-Here you go.

128
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,480
Free.

129
00:10:09,560 --> 00:10:10,720
On the house.

130
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:12,400
Okay, thank you.

131
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:15,640
Let's take a selfie
for an Instagram story.

132
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:18,480
Oh, I gotta pee. I'm off to the toilet.

133
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:59,720
Embarrassed in front of your friends?

134
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,520
Wouldn't you be?

135
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:05,720
Why though? It's an honest job.
We're not scamming anybody.

136
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:11,000
Look. You've been doing great
at selling today, you know?

137
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:14,240
If you can sell meatballs
like this every day,

138
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:16,680
you can definitely help Auem
pay off the debt.

139
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:20,600
But I don't want to be
just a meatball seller.

140
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:22,280
It's tiring and hot. So little money.

141
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:25,200
If Auntie hadn't promised
to return my concert ticket,

142
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:26,240
I'd never do this.

143
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:36,360
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">I'd like to preorder three pairs of these.</font></font></i>

144
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:44,560
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Okay. Please wait three to ten days.</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">You can pay half now as a deposit.</font></font></i>

145
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:48,200
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">I'll send you the bank details.</font></font></i>

146
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,840
This is making money much faster.

147
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:01,720
And now, let's announce
our three buffaloes

148
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:04,600
that made it to the finals
in the category of male albinos,

149
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:06,640
senior milk-tooth division!

150
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:09,600
The first number is…

151
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:15,680
Number 42! Thong Tae
from Chok Charoensuk Farm!

152
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:18,800
-Thong Tae!
-Thong Tae!

153
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:25,120
Next is Number 31,
Suk Thawi from Kamnan San Farm!

154
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:33,240
And our last finalist is…

155
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:39,400
Wow, all eyes are certainly on me.

156
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:41,320
I can feel the pressure!

157
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:43,080
Number…

158
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:48,280
Number 27! Phetkla
from Dan Dao Buffalo Farm!

159
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:03,800
Hey, Din.

160
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:05,200
Phetkla just made it through.

161
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:08,520
And have you found Uncle Tik?

162
00:13:10,680 --> 00:13:12,000
What?

163
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:13,200
You haven't?

164
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:17,240
If Por Chang doesn't see him
in the next round, we're done for.

165
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:27,280
Din.

166
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:29,600
No luck at the parking lot
and first-aid tent.

167
00:13:29,680 --> 00:13:31,080
Where the hell did he go?

168
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,240
Sir. Sir.

169
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:35,640
Have you found Tik?

170
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:39,120
No. But Por Chang just broke out
and ran to the back of the showground.

171
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:40,200
Go check on him.

172
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:43,000
This way, sir.

173
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:47,520
Here he is.

174
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:49,000
Chang.

175
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:51,400
Chang.

176
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:52,480
What's wrong?

177
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:56,200
Where are you going, Chang?

178
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:59,480
-What's going on?
-Let's just follow him.

179
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:00,400
Chang!

180
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:08,040
-Tik! Tik!
-Uncle!

181
00:14:08,760 --> 00:14:09,800
Uncle Tik!

182
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:10,840
-Geez!
-Uncle!

183
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:17,280
-Uncle!
-Who did this to you, Tik?

184
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,840
Let's help him up first.

185
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:28,240
Go. Let's go. Go.

186
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:53,960
Thong Tae's stance is just so majestic.

187
00:14:54,040 --> 00:14:56,280
He's well-proportioned.

188
00:14:56,880 --> 00:15:00,800
His body depth, thickness, and length
are all well-proportioned to his height.

189
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:03,360
Both horns are equally glossy.

190
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:10,080
As for Suk Thawi, he has a thick hide
and a large frame.

191
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:14,680
He's healthy, with glossy skin
and well-defined muscles.

192
00:15:14,760 --> 00:15:17,560
His eyes are large and full.
His back is thick and sturdy.

193
00:15:17,640 --> 00:15:21,280
Too bad his neck's too long,
and his belly hangs too low.

194
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:24,720
They make him look overweight.
His horns are also uneven.

195
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:27,800
As for Phetkla, he's well-proportioned,

196
00:15:28,560 --> 00:15:30,440
but his stance isn't quite majestic.

197
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:34,080
His chest lacks fullness.
His rump might look fairly firm,

198
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:36,720
but when you feel it,
you can tell it's actually saggy.

199
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:39,040
Small, uneven testicles.

200
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:40,880
His hoof joints are long and uneven.

201
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:42,960
That's all from me.

202
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:52,240
What the hell?

203
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:54,120
He looks nothing like that description.

204
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:56,000
-He looks much nicer than Thong Tae.
-Yeah.

205
00:15:56,760 --> 00:15:58,600
Look at his firm chest and rump.

206
00:15:58,680 --> 00:16:00,600
-What the hell?
-Yeah.

207
00:16:00,680 --> 00:16:04,720
And now, I will announce
our first-place winner

208
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:07,000
in the category of male albinos,

209
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:09,040
senior milk-tooth division!

210
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:14,360
And the buffalo that takes first place is…

211
00:16:15,040 --> 00:16:16,400
-Phetkla! Phetkla!
-Phetkla!

212
00:16:16,480 --> 00:16:18,680
-Phetkla!
-Phetkla!

213
00:16:18,760 --> 00:16:20,120
Number…

214
00:16:21,280 --> 00:16:26,960
Number 42! Thong Tae
from Chok Charoensuk Farm.

215
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:31,080
Thong Tae!

216
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:33,520
Thong Tae!

217
00:16:35,400 --> 00:16:36,360
What?

218
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:37,800
-Hey!
-Hey!

219
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:38,880
Boo!

220
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:41,280
Hang on. Did the judge
make the right decision?

221
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:43,280
The hell? Phetkla looks a lot nicer!

222
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:47,120
Come on, now.

223
00:16:47,880 --> 00:16:49,240
Don't be a sore loser.

224
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:51,640
The judge called it as he saw it.

225
00:16:53,040 --> 00:16:55,600
Phetkla deserves to win. Right, guys?

226
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:56,520
Right?

227
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:58,360
-Phetkla! Phetkla!
-Phetkla!

228
00:16:58,440 --> 00:17:00,680
Phetkla! Phetkla!

229
00:17:00,760 --> 00:17:02,000
Phetkla! Phetkla!

230
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:05,160
I demand a new round of judging.

231
00:17:08,800 --> 00:17:10,800
WINNER
FIRST-RUNNER UP

232
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:32,120
Sia Aun, please come to the ring.

233
00:17:38,760 --> 00:17:39,760
Let's go.

234
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:42,600
What's going on?

235
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:50,840
Uncle Tik saw our judge

236
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:52,920
talking to Sia Aun in his car

237
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:56,080
and bribing him. Is this true?

238
00:17:57,200 --> 00:17:58,360
What bribe?

239
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:00,800
Why are you accusing me?

240
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:06,200
I'm not. I saw it with my own eyes.

241
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:16,520
I didn't do it.

242
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:20,560
What proof do you have
to accuse me like that?

243
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:23,160
I got you on video.

244
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:27,600
But your man whacked me on the head
and took the phone. It was you!

245
00:18:33,520 --> 00:18:36,680
If you're sure it was Sia Aun's man,
who is it?

246
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:46,040
Oh?

247
00:18:48,400 --> 00:18:49,560
You've got no evidence.

248
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:51,720
No witness.

249
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:53,560
Wow.

250
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:55,120
An accusation like that

251
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:56,920
can hurt my reputation, you know.

252
00:18:58,760 --> 00:18:59,680
Tik.

