00:34:25,800 --> 00:34:29,520
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Guys, look at this big</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">and chewy sweet potato!</font></font></i>

506
00:34:29,600 --> 00:34:32,639
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">It's so soft! I heard</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">it's a Japanese sweet potato.</font></font></i>

507
00:34:33,440 --> 00:34:36,520
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">I can snack away while working</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">and taking care of my buffaloes.</font></font></i>

508
00:34:40,840 --> 00:34:44,040
I sent one of my guys there.
Apparently, Phetkla's semen is a big hit.

509
00:34:44,120 --> 00:34:46,679
Even those who wanted to buy semen
from our farm at first

510
00:34:46,760 --> 00:34:48,520
decided to buy from them instead.

511
00:34:48,600 --> 00:34:51,600
And Tik still won't sell
Por Chang's semen.

512
00:34:52,880 --> 00:34:54,920
What would you like me to do next?

513
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:57,480
They're getting a lot of attention.

514
00:34:58,680 --> 00:35:01,640
We might be in trouble
if we try anything now.

515
00:35:03,560 --> 00:35:06,080
Just find the buffaloes
our customers ordered.

516
00:35:06,160 --> 00:35:07,440
Got it.

517
00:35:07,520 --> 00:35:09,560
I'm going to the northeast then.

518
00:35:12,200 --> 00:35:15,040
We're not making any money
from buffalo semen sales,

519
00:35:17,000 --> 00:35:19,320
so we have to find another way
to make up for it.

520
00:35:21,080 --> 00:35:21,960
Of course.

521
00:35:41,560 --> 00:35:43,440
Five thousand, Aunt Tang.

522
00:35:46,040 --> 00:35:48,520
Eight thousand, Uncle Pom.

523
00:35:54,400 --> 00:35:55,440
Auem.

524
00:35:56,160 --> 00:35:57,040
Hmm?

525
00:35:57,120 --> 00:36:00,840
Can I get a thousand baht
extra this month?

526
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:04,600
I want to buy some face cream.

527
00:36:05,240 --> 00:36:07,720
I've been boiling meatballs all day.

528
00:36:07,800 --> 00:36:09,280
The skin on my face is ruined. See?

529
00:36:09,360 --> 00:36:10,200
Here.

530
00:36:15,680 --> 00:36:17,600
Oh, I know.

531
00:36:17,680 --> 00:36:20,440
There's this sunscreen
a client sent me for a review.

532
00:36:20,520 --> 00:36:23,480
They sent me a bunch of tubes.
I'll grab one for you from upstairs.

533
00:36:23,560 --> 00:36:24,760
Come on.

534
00:36:24,840 --> 00:36:28,720
Sunscreen and moisturizer
aren't the same thing.

535
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:31,720
-That's sunscreen. I want a moisturizer.
-Hello? Yes.

536
00:36:31,800 --> 00:36:34,040
-Want one?
-You're here already?

537
00:36:34,120 --> 00:36:35,200
I'm coming.

538
00:36:41,800 --> 00:36:43,520
Come eat.

539
00:36:48,080 --> 00:36:49,520
This one is for you, Auem.

540
00:36:50,440 --> 00:36:51,640
What's for dinner?

541
00:36:51,720 --> 00:36:53,560
Don't they look yummy?

542
00:36:56,640 --> 00:36:58,520
What did you order, dear?

543
00:36:58,600 --> 00:37:01,840
-Grilled prawns.
-Huh? Grilled prawns?

544
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:03,240
They smell delicious!

545
00:37:03,880 --> 00:37:06,120
Wow, you sure ordered a lot!

546
00:37:06,200 --> 00:37:09,480
-They're still hot.
-I bought these with my sales money.

547
00:37:11,880 --> 00:37:13,680
Mom, you mentioned face cream just now?

548
00:37:15,240 --> 00:37:16,480
One sec.

549
00:37:16,560 --> 00:37:17,640
What is it?

550
00:37:18,200 --> 00:37:19,200
Here.

551
00:37:20,120 --> 00:37:21,400
What's this?

552
00:37:21,480 --> 00:37:23,480
It's for your face cream.

553
00:37:23,560 --> 00:37:24,520
Oh my.

554
00:37:25,400 --> 00:37:26,840
Two thousand?

555
00:37:29,480 --> 00:37:30,800
Two thousand!

556
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:35,040
Thank you, sweetheart.

557
00:37:35,120 --> 00:37:36,280
Thank you.

558
00:37:36,360 --> 00:37:39,600
Your pre-ordered shoes

559
00:37:39,680 --> 00:37:41,200
are selling that well?

560
00:37:42,120 --> 00:37:43,440
Scrutinizing me again?

561
00:37:44,560 --> 00:37:48,440
I made more money than you.
I bet you didn't think I could do it.

562
00:37:50,120 --> 00:37:51,920
Why are you getting mad, though?

563
00:37:52,000 --> 00:37:53,760
She just asked you a simple question.

564
00:37:54,600 --> 00:37:56,320
You guys just mind your buffaloes.

565
00:37:57,720 --> 00:37:59,760
Come on, Mom. Let's eat.

566
00:38:00,920 --> 00:38:02,360
This one's huge.

567
00:38:03,440 --> 00:38:05,640
-Thanks. Wow, it's still hot.
-Ob, pass me the rice.

568
00:38:06,680 --> 00:38:07,600
What about me?

569
00:38:07,680 --> 00:38:09,040
Help yourself.

570
00:38:09,120 --> 00:38:12,520
KNOWLEDGE WITH VIRTUE
VIRTUE, EDUCATION, ADVANCING SOCIETY

571
00:38:19,920 --> 00:38:23,000
Orn, that one's 3,000.
You sure you can afford that?

572
00:38:23,080 --> 00:38:24,480
It's only 3,000.

573
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:27,920
I'll get this one too.

574
00:38:28,760 --> 00:38:29,880
Looks nice.

575
00:38:37,640 --> 00:38:41,760
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Excuse me. I ordered my shoes months ago.</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Where even are they?</font></font></i>

576
00:38:41,840 --> 00:38:44,720
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Am I getting my shoes or what?</font></font></i>

577
00:38:44,800 --> 00:38:46,440
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">If not, I want a refund.</font></font></i>

578
00:40:16,040 --> 00:40:21,160
Subtitle translation by:
Narawan Promprakai
